-- Rendered by Terraform (modules/compose-stack). Runs ONCE at Postgres
-- cluster init (mounted under /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d), before the
-- socket opens for application connections.
--
-- The Exchange and Broker share the default `ramp` database (separate
-- schemas). Two more are always created by the module: `identity` for the
-- Identity Service, and `sor` for the Exchange's System of Record, which runs
-- on a second pool and migrates itself at boot but never creates its own
-- database. Further databases appear here when a multi-exchange topology sets
-- extra_databases — each additional exchange instance owns a separate catalog
-- database so the global DiscoverResources read cannot leak one publisher's
-- catalog onto another exchange.
%{ for db in extra_databases }
CREATE DATABASE ${db};
%{ endfor }
